000100*================================================================
000200* RDCYB  CYBER RISK DETAIL
000300*        THE 60-BYTE POL-RISK-DETAIL OF POLREC FOR LINE CYB.
000400*        USED BY RATCYB01.
000500*        policy-admin FILLS THE SAME 60 BYTES IN PRMCOMM
000600*        REQ-RISK-DETAIL WHEN IT CALLS PRMCALC0.
000700*
000800*  REVENUE-K       ANNUAL REVENUE, THOUSANDS
000900*  RECORDS-K       PERSONAL RECORDS HELD, THOUSANDS
001000*  MFA             Y = MFA ON ALL REMOTE ACCESS
001100*  SECTOR          H HEALTH, F FINANCE, R RETAIL
001200*  BACKUPS-OFFLINE Y = OFFLINE BACKUPS TESTED
001300*  PRIOR-BREACH    Y = BREACH IN LAST 3 YEARS
001400*================================================================
001500 01  WS-CYB-DETAIL.
001600     05  WS-REVENUE-K             PIC 9(07).
001700     05  WS-RECORDS-K             PIC 9(06).
001800     05  WS-MFA                   PIC X(01).
001900     05  WS-SECTOR                PIC X(01).
002000     05  WS-BACKUPS-OFFLINE       PIC X(01).
002100     05  WS-PRIOR-BREACH          PIC X(01).
002200     05  FILLER                  PIC X(43).
